OL,3,AUK warned over ballooning debt costs
OL,4,Aand slower growth ahead of Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK has been warned over ballooning
OL,7,Fdebt costs and slower economic growth
OL,8,Fahead of Chancellor John Healey's first
OL,9,FBudget next month.
OL,11,FThe UK was among countries facing
OL,12,Fdowngraded growth forecasts in a report
OL,13,Fby the influential Organisation of
OL,14,FEconomic Co-operation and Development
OL,15,F(OECD) on Wednesday.
OL,17,FThat came as the head of the
OL,18,FInternational Monetary Fund (IMF) told
OL,19,Fthe BBC that Britain and the US needed
OL,20,Fto reduce debt due to spiralling
OL,21,Fborrowing costs.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
